# Scouting — Questions & Perspectives (Repos)

> Run `foundations.md` first (creates the shared glossaries + perspectives
> this file references by name). This file only adds the Scouting Funnel
> Stage term and Scouting's own questions. Run with VALIDATE first, then
> PROCESS.
>
> Model: Question (Glossary Term, classified as Question) — Perspective
> (Actor, from foundations.md) — Link Perspective to Question (question x
> perspective) — Link Element To Scope / ScopedBy (question x intent, via
> the Funnel Stages term below). Authored directly for now (not derived
> from Survey/Analytic "answers" links) — this is the requirements
> artifact that will later shape what Survey Types and Analytics get
> built, not something computed from analytics that don't exist yet.
>
> Bindings here are metadata, not code — expected to evolve per-deployment
> and over time. This is one manifestation; changing a question's
> perspective/intent links later is a Link/Unlink command, not a schema
> migration.

