# Funnel stage term

## Create Glossary Term

### Glossary Name
Funnel Stages

### Display Name
Scouting

### Description
Broad inventory across many resources, fast, summary view — is this
resource active, roughly what is it, is it worth a closer look at all.
Answerable from cheap, already-available metadata (e.g. the GitHub API for
repos) — no deep content analysis needed at this stage.

